# Running and vaulting in the grey box (game/walker.h), booted on foot in the corridor: Up held
# all the way builds to a run in ~0.8 s. At a run the crate (40, before the stairs) is vaulted:
# up onto it, the eye following, and off its end in a jump to the floor. Then up the stairs (the
# eye gliding, not jolting) and off the platform's end in a jump onto the lower roof (64), and on
# into the tower. Shots every ~0.25 s round the crate (~5 s in) and the platform (~8 s).
# Film it with tests\e2eun_e2e.ps1 -Steps run_vault.steps (built with BOOT_ON_FOOT 1)
wait_up
shot rv_00_stood
keydown up
wait 2
shot rv_01_running
wait 2
shot rv_02_crate
wait 0.12
shot rv_03_crate
wait 0.12
shot rv_04_crate
wait 0.12
shot rv_05_crate
wait 0.12
shot rv_06_crate
wait 0.12
shot rv_07_crate
wait 0.12
shot rv_08_crate
wait 0.12
shot rv_09_crate
wait 0.12
shot rv_10_crate
wait 0.12
shot rv_11_crate
wait 0.12
shot rv_12_crate
wait 0.12
shot rv_13_crate
wait 0.12
wait 0.6
shot rv_14_stairs
wait 0.12
shot rv_15_stairs
wait 0.12
shot rv_16_stairs
wait 0.12
shot rv_17_stairs
wait 0.12
shot rv_18_stairs
wait 0.12
shot rv_19_stairs
wait 0.12
